{
  "conversations": [
    {
      "conversationId": "mo&krill_seven_convo01",
      "lines": [
        {
          "order": 1,
          "character": "Mo&krill",
          "audioFile": "krill_match_start_gigawatt_krill_convo01_01",
          "audioUrl": "audio/krill_match_start_gigawatt_krill_convo01_01.mp3",
          "text": "I hear you've made the old subway tunnels your home.",
          "duration": 3.568
        },
        {
          "order": 2,
          "character": "Seven",
          "audioFile": "gigawatt_match_start_gigawatt_krill_convo01_02",
          "audioUrl": "audio/gigawatt_match_start_gigawatt_krill_convo01_02.mp3",
          "text": "Temporarily, yes.",
          "duration": 1.42
        },
        {
          "order": 3,
          "character": "Mo&krill",
          "audioFile": "krill_match_start_gigawatt_krill_convo01_03",
          "audioUrl": "audio/krill_match_start_gigawatt_krill_convo01_03.mp3",
          "text": "We never gave you permision",
          "duration": 2.267
        },
        {
          "order": 4,
          "character": "Seven",
          "audioFile": "gigawatt_match_start_gigawatt_krill_convo01_04",
          "audioUrl": "audio/gigawatt_match_start_gigawatt_krill_convo01_04.mp3",
          "text": "That's because I didn't ask.",
          "duration": 1.74
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "conversationId": "mo&krill_seven_convo02",
      "lines": [
        {
          "order": 1,
          "character": "Seven",
          "audioFile": "gigawatt_match_start_gigawatt_krill_convo02_01",
          "audioUrl": "audio/gigawatt_match_start_gigawatt_krill_convo02_01.mp3",
          "text": "Gentlemen, a word?",
          "duration": 1.534
        },
        {
          "order": 2,
          "character": "Mo&krill",
          "audioFile": "krill_match_start_gigawatt_krill_convo02_02",
          "audioUrl": "audio/krill_match_start_gigawatt_krill_convo02_02.mp3",
          "text": "What is it Seven?",
          "duration": 1.38
        },
        {
          "order": 3,
          "character": "Seven",
          "audioFile": "gigawatt_match_start_gigawatt_krill_convo02_03",
          "audioUrl": "audio/gigawatt_match_start_gigawatt_krill_convo02_03.mp3",
          "text": "After the ritual, I have some particular needs in regards to new tunnels\u2026",
          "duration": 5.488
        },
        {
          "order": 4,
          "character": "Mo&krill",
          "audioFile": "krill_match_start_gigawatt_krill_convo02_04",
          "audioUrl": "audio/krill_match_start_gigawatt_krill_convo02_04.mp3",
          "text": "Is the OSIC still looking for you?",
          "duration": 2.592
        },
        {
          "order": 5,
          "character": "Seven",
          "audioFile": "gigawatt_match_start_gigawatt_krill_convo02_05",
          "audioUrl": "audio/gigawatt_match_start_gigawatt_krill_convo02_05.mp3",
          "text": "If they weren't I wouldn't have particular needs in regards to new tunnels.",
          "duration": 5.25
        },
        {
          "order": 6,
          "character": "Mo&krill",
          "audioFile": "krill_match_start_gigawatt_krill_convo02_06",
          "audioUrl": "audio/krill_match_start_gigawatt_krill_convo02_06.mp3",
          "text": "We can help, but the rate will be higher",
          "duration": 4.22
        },
        {
          "order": 7,
          "character": "Seven",
          "audioFile": "gigawatt_match_start_gigawatt_krill_convo02_07",
          "audioUrl": "audio/gigawatt_match_start_gigawatt_krill_convo02_07.mp3",
          "text": "I expected nothing less.",
          "duration": 1.825
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "conversationId": "mo&krill_seven_convo03",
      "lines": [
        {
          "order": 1,
          "character": "Mo&krill",
          "audioFile": "krill_match_start_gigawatt_krill_convo03_01",
          "audioUrl": "audio/krill_match_start_gigawatt_krill_convo03_01.mp3",
          "text": "Do you want to come up with a plan.",
          "duration": 3.326
        },
        {
          "order": 2,
          "character": "Seven",
          "audioFile": "gigawatt_match_start_gigawatt_krill_convo03_02",
          "audioUrl": "audio/gigawatt_match_start_gigawatt_krill_convo03_02.mp3",
          "text": "The mole grabs them, then I make them suffer.",
          "duration": 3.331
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}